\u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052207 - Disable OptimizeIteratorIndices optimization.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310355\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311775\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/JitOptions.cpp"], "git_node": "c527ee51956e01de5b89645ce62d8b8abefb709f", "git_parents": ["9ab2d0e7c73fd65782c562ff601fc1f44a7bcdca"], "node": "c673db53cc00cb5a42be2439f1ee301540f68a86", "parents": ["216526ea35d30bd58a29169d43869e80a92552ff"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783928312, "git_changesets": ["c527ee51956e01de5b89645ce62d8b8abefb709f"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1405": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053576 - Clamp number of components assigned by SetDetailedGlyphs.  a=pascalc\n\n(Based on clauditor-suggested patch)\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311412\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311779\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxFont.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxTextRun.cpp"], "git_node": "db3d7774de0f25ee6aba797b90921d061325bf91", "git_parents": ["c527ee51956e01de5b89645ce62d8b8abefb709f"], "node": "db87f519aab263e3276bbc96244020a0bf88d056", "parents": ["c673db53cc00cb5a42be2439f1ee301540f68a86"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783929221, "git_changesets": ["db3d7774de0f25ee6aba797b90921d061325bf91"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1406": {"changesets": [{"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052841. Don't taint a same-origin response that a service worker substitutes for a cross-origin request.  a=pascalc\n\nWhen a service worker answers a cross-origin request with a same-origin\nresource (respondWith(fetch(\u003csame-origin URL\u003e))), the response is delivered as\nan internal redirect from the cross-origin request URL to the same-origin\nresponse URL. nsITimedChannel's allRedirectsSameOrigin counts that internal\nredirect as a cross-origin hop, so consumers that use it to decide tainting\n(image loads, stylesheets, media) treat the resource as cross-origin and taint\nit -- even though the bytes are same-origin and should be readable.\n\nAdd nsITimedChannel::allRedirectsSameOriginIgnoringInternal, computed like\nallRedirectsSameOrigin but ignoring internal (e.g. service-worker response-URL)\nredirects, and switch the tainting consumers (imgRequestProxy, the CSS Loader,\nand the media resources) to it. Real cross-origin redirects still flip it, so\ngenuine cross-origin loads (including bounce-backs) still taint. Other users of\nallRedirectsSameOrigin (resource timing, Fetch body-access) intentionally keep\nthe original flag.\n\nAdd a service-worker regression test for the same-origin substitution case\n(CSS).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311508\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/DOMTypes.ipdlh", "dom/media/ChannelMediaResource.cpp", "dom/media/CloneableWithRangeMediaResource.cpp", "dom/media/FileMediaResource.cpp", "image/imgRequestProxy.cpp", "netwerk/base/nsITimedChannel.idl", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpBaseChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpBaseChannel.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelChild.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelParams.ipdlh", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelParent.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/NullHttpChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/NullHttpChannel.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/service-workers/service-worker/css-sw-same-origin-substitution.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/service-workers/service-worker/resources/css-sw-same-origin-substitution-iframe.sub.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/service-workers/service-worker/resources/css-sw-same-origin-substitution-worker.js"], "git_node": "0d65f316b09b862ed2f356d741e9c29a7dc24dba", "git_parents": ["db3d7774de0f25ee6aba797b90921d061325bf91"], "node": "48c77d9638b43d469d27b7c3662b18a229e39806", "parents": ["db87f519aab263e3276bbc96244020a0bf88d056"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783930408, "git_changesets": ["0d65f316b09b862ed2f356d741e9c29a7dc24dba"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1407": {"changesets": [{"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050626.  a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311509\n", "files": ["image/imgRequest.cpp", "image/imgRequest.h", "image/imgRequestProxy.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/fetch/images/canvas-remote-read-remote-image-redirect.html.ini"], "git_node": "f76e3b5035d638137e836b581a9c52fbe9882914", "git_parents": ["0d65f316b09b862ed2f356d741e9c29a7dc24dba"], "node": "73bb47ff82a51de5e91e24b2d615f18d734abd70", "parents": ["48c77d9638b43d469d27b7c3662b18a229e39806"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783930750, "git_changesets": ["f76e3b5035d638137e836b581a9c52fbe9882914"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1408": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes -  a=pascalc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311791\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "b804153f91deeb832b5349365829ea191b482f28", "git_parents": ["f76e3b5035d638137e836b581a9c52fbe9882914"], "node": "1fbd3920b80d443c4265160a5ead8b6a60e718cf", "parents": ["73bb47ff82a51de5e91e24b2d615f18d734abd70"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783933659, "git_changesets": ["b804153f91deeb832b5349365829ea191b482f28"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1409": {"changesets": [{"author": "Vincent Hilla \u003cvhilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2048851 - Clear principalToInherit in LoadPageAsViewSource.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309163\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311788\n", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "toolkit/components/viewsource/test/browser/browser.ini", "toolkit/components/viewsource/test/browser/browser_bug2048851.js", "toolkit/components/viewsource/test/browser/file_bug2048851.html"], "git_node": "8d429c8c4df76791a68bfdcdaaa7fd5cdd9f358f", "git_parents": ["b804153f91deeb832b5349365829ea191b482f28"], "node": "dc09992fb7b33b5dbfb78a2718f595e13056f389", "parents": ["1fbd3920b80d443c4265160a5ead8b6a60e718cf"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783933725, "git_changesets": ["8d429c8c4df76791a68bfdcdaaa7fd5cdd9f358f"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "1410": {"changesets": [{"author": "Matthew Gregan \u003ckinetik@flim.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052753 - Update cubeb-pulse-rs to 405f174 to reject start() on a draining stream.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nBackport of upstream cubeb-pulse-rs commit\n88194f91c8778fa608a19af7b91306094525595d, carried on the\nmozilla/cubeb-pulse-rs esr115 branch.\n\nThe backport adapts the error construction to the cubeb-backend version\nvendored on this branch (Error::error() rather than Error::Error).\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310552\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311957\n", "files": [".cargo/config.in", "Cargo.lock", "third_party/rust/cubeb-pulse/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/cubeb-pulse/src/backend/stream.rs", "toolkit/library/rust/shared/Cargo.toml"], "git_node": "4bc2734dec80d9df7d74be2ec2772db9e6f3a94a", "git_parents": ["8d429c8c4df76791a68bfdcdaaa7fd5cdd9f358f"], "node": "1ef5c73b865c77a80aa064857512f97912d81e91", "parents": ["dc09992fb7b33b5dbfb78a2718f595e13056f389"], "tags": []}], "date": 1783989075, "git_changesets": ["4bc2734dec80d9df7d74be2ec2772db9e6f3a94a"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1411": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u00